        </nav>
    </aside>

    <h2 id="migrate-survey">Migrate a survey</h2>
    <p>To migrate a survey, use our Statistical Preparation Platform. You can create surveys using validation rule templates and by importing survey form schema files. This ensures that surveys are consistent and meet ONS standards.</p>

    <h3>Before you begin</h3>
    <p>Before migrating a survey you must have prepared the following:</p>

    {{
        onsDetails({
            "id": "survey-forms-details",
            "title": "Survey forms",
            "content": "<p>Survey forms should be configured using Author and stored locally as JSON files on your computer to upload as part of survey migration.</p>"
        })
    }}

    {{
        onsDetails({
            "id": "reference-data-details",
            "title": "Reference data",
            "content": "<p>Tested and validated reference data CSV files that comply with existing reference datasets in SPP.</p>"
        })
    }}

    {{
        onsDetails({
            "id": "validation-rules-details",
            "title": "Validation rules",
            "content": "<p>Documented and agreed validation rules that have been approved by business survey teams.</p>"
        })
    }}

    <h3 class="ons-u-mt-l">Set up a survey</h3>
    <p>To set up a new survey, ensure that you have defined your survey aims and prepared the survey forms.</p>

    {{
        onsButton({
            "text": "Set up survey",
            "classes": "ons-u-mt-m",
            "url": pageInfo.rootPath + "/views/tasklist/tasklist.html",
            "noIcon": true
        })
    }}

